                                                "sense_id": "756f979c-117a-38d1-b9d7-71ddbf1fefcb",
                                                "text": "Roasting the ores is done with the charcoal braze (or fine charcoal from the charring) in heaps of thirty feet width, fifty-feet length and twenty feet height, containing 3,200 tons."
